rld he showed a willingness to  kill even the celestial dragons  themselves on top of their slaves and  everyone else who dared to challenge him  more than 40 years ago he gathered his  crew on the island of hachinosu and set  out to accomplish his ultimate goal  although the specifics of that goal are  still unknown other than the fact that  he declared war on the world government  and that he wanted to be the king of the  world we know very little about rox's  true intentions his combat strategy and  his ultimate motivations why was he  doing what he was doing was it just for  wealth and power or was there more to  the story the only major clue that we  have about rox's ultimate goal is the  infamous god valley incident which  occurred 38 years ago the entire  incident was deliberately hushed up and  concealed from the world by the world  government and today only the older  generations of marines are even aware  that the incident occurred we know that  zepek and his overpowered crew attacked  a mysterious island called god valley  and according to sengoku multiple  celestial dragons were present on god  valley at the time of the attack sengoku  didn't specify how many celestial  dragons were present or which ones were  actually there we just know that some of  them were on the island along with their  slaves it is possible that these were  high-ranking world nobles such as the  gorosei because in order to defeat zebek  and protect these celestial dragons the  world government resorted to something  unheard of they actually teamed up with  the future pirate king goldie roger in  order to take zebic down garp and roger  worked together to defeat zebek and it  was during this battle that garp earned  his title as hero of the marines after  what must have been one of the greatest  battles in the history of one piece  zebek was defeated and the rock's  pirates were dissolved unfortunately we  still know very little about the battle  itself and how exactly garp and roger  managed to win but that is precisely  what makes this legendary incident so  fascinating practically every one piece  fan is hoping for an extended god valley  flashback that will finally reveal how  it all went down and that will allow us  to learn more about the mysterious rocks  d zebic as i said before the truth about  the entire incident was then heavily  censored by the world government and the  island of god valley itself vanished  from the face of the earth we don't know  how or why it vanished but now it is  gone and it cannot be found on any map  also this presumably isn't an instance  of the world government calling in a  buster call to blow everything up on the  island in sengoku's own words the island  disappeared entirely if it had been  destroyed by a buster call he could have  just said that but even though the world  government attempted to erase zebec and  god valley from history they could not  erase zebec's legacy and in many ways  zebek completely changed the world of  one piece and he shaped it into what it  is today roger garp whitebeard big mom  and kaido wouldn't have become the  people we know today if it wasn't for  zebic meaning that we may not have even  had a new golden age of piracy and luffy  may never have become a pirate if it  weren't for zebic if you're interested  in how zebek impacted the world of one  piece including the entire warlord  system the rise of blackbeard and even  luffy's own journey check out our video  explaining all 10 members of the d-clan  and their powers link in the description  naturally because of all the mystery  that surrounds both zebec and god valley  there is no shortage of theories about  all of this within the one piece  community and some of these theories are  truly compelling and if they turned out  to be true they would explain a lot  about the world of one piece and about  the family history of several important  characters such as luffy and shanks the  first theory i want to discuss is the  theory that rox d zepek is actually  luffy's other grandfather there are two  versions of this theory one states that  luffy's mother is actually the daughter  of zebek and she may have first come  into contact with garp and his son  dragon during the god valley incident we  know that garp always wanted both his  son and his grandson to follow in his  footsteps and to become marines so it is  possible that a young dragon was  actually there with garp at the time of  the god valley incident dragon would  have been like 17 years old back then so  he may have been a new recruit or a  marine in training under the direct  supervision of his father garp in their  capacity as marines garp and dragon  would have been tasked with rescuing the  celestial dragons before zebek got to  them dragon may have taken part in this  rescue operation which would explain why  garp fought so hard to protect the  celestial dragons even though he hates  them and it would also explain why garp  was willing to work with roger even  though he hates pirates if his own son  was present on the island then his son's  safety would also depend on garp  defeating zebek so garp did what he had  to do not just to protect the world  nobles whom he hates but also to protect  his own son  and what if zebek had a daughter and  after his ultimate defeat at god valley  that daughter was taken into custody by  the marines  while in custody this daughter could  have met garp and dragon and perhaps  eventually her and dragon fell in love  since the world government was so  determined to erase zebek and the god  valley incident from history it's  possible that they were planning to  execute everyone associated with zebec  in any way including his daughter even  if she did nothing wrong  and that could be the moment that dragon  turned against the world government and  embarked on a personal mission to  destroy it instead of executing zebek's  daughter he betrayed the marines and ran  away with her and so dragon became an  outlaw and fugitive from that day  forward and while we don't know what  happened to luffy's mom after that her  absence from the story could be directly  connected to the fact that she is  zebec's daughter and that means that the  world government wants to eliminate her  at all costs so it would make sense for  her to keep a distance from luffy  because she doesn't want luffy to get  involved the second version of this  theory also suggests that zebec is  luffy's other grandfather but not  because zebek is the father of luffy's  mom but rather because zebek is actually  the real father of luffy's dad dragon  this theory is based on the fact that  monkey d dragon doesn't exactly look  like his father garp but he does look  quite a bit like the few images that  we've seen of zebek according to this  theory zebic had his young 17 year old  son with him at god valley and after his  defeat zebek's son was taken in by garp  garp is actually luffy's maternal  grandfather and dragon became garp's  son-in-law after marrying his daughter  dragon began using the name a monkey  d-dragon instead of rocks the dragon  because he wanted to hide his connection  to zebic since that connection would  have made him a massive target in the  early stages of his life i mean as the  leader of the revolutionaries he is now  a massive target either way but that  would not have been the case back when  he was only 17 so the name change could  have made sense back then sadly this  theory doesn't really explain the  current whereabouts of luffy's mother or  why garp never talks about his own  daughter but it's an interesting idea  nonetheless then there's the crazy  theory that zebek may actually be  luffy's grandmother yes zebek was  actually a woman who adopted a masculine  persona in order to command more respect  in the traditionally male pirate world  there are actual historic examples of  this in our own world with female  pirates dressing up like men or even  posing as men during their pirating  careers and the idea here is that garp  and zebek were actually lovers but they  had a falling out when zebek decided to  declare war on the world government  dragon is actually the son of garp and  zebek and that is why he shares some of  zebec's physical features i'm not saying  that this is a likely theory but if  you've been holding out hope for an  intense romantic subplot featuring garp  then this is probably your best bet  another fun theory is that zebek may  actually be the father of shanks we've  always wondered why shanks and buggy  ended up on roger's ship at such a young  age and one possible explanation is that  shanks was zebek's son who was taken in  by roger after zebek's defeat at god  valley shanks would have only been like  one year old at the time so he wouldn't  even remember anything about zebek and  roger's crew would be the only family he  ever knew i personally really like this  theory if for no other reason than  because it would confirm shanks is a  member of the d-clan and seriously rox d  shanks sounds pretty badass shanks being  zebek's son who was rescued by roger as  a baby would also make for a great  addition to the god valley flashback and  since we know that shanks will come back  to the story sometime soon such a reveal  could be made when shanks and luffy  reunite finally there is the theory that  zebek is the father of blackbeard and  there are some direct connections  between these two infamous pirates for  one thing zebek and blackbeard are the  only two members of the d-clan who have  shown themselves to be ruthless and  machiavellian in the pursuit of their  ultimate goals  now all d-clan members seem destined to  change the world in some way but most of  them are fighting for freedom friendship  and other noble goals zebek and  blackbeard are clearly different and  they are willing to kill and destroy  everyone and everything that stands in  the way of their mission they believe in  freedom through power and they are  interested in absolute freedom for  themselves at the expense of others  luffy roger dragon and other d-clan  members seem more interested in freedom  for everyone and they are motivated by  things like friendship and loyalty not  greed and power on top of that  blackbeard even named his ship the sabre  of zebek which suggests that blackbeard  wants to embrace zebek's mission and  legacy some have suggested that the  yamami nomi blackbeard's first devil  fruit once belonged to zebik and that is  why blackbeard was so determined to find  this one specific fruit blackbeard would  have been about two years old when the  god valley incident occurred so  theoretically he could be zebek's son  who is determined to get revenge for his  father that said he could also just  admire zebek's ambition and thirst for  power as well as zebec's willingness to  boldly stand against the entire world  the big question is this  is zebek really dead like sengoku  suggests or is he still out there  somewhere if zebec is somehow still  alive then the theory that he had the  yami yami no me wouldn't make sense but  if he really is dead then this theory is  plausible blackbeard seems to be  consciously following in zebek's  footsteps he made hachinosu his base of  operations just like zebek he named his  ship the sabre of zebek and if the zebek  yamiyami nomi theory is correct then we  know that blackbeard did everything in  his power to consume zebek's former  devil fruit blackbeard also has the same  machiavellian ruthlessness as zebek did  and it's almost certain that blackbeard  shares the same ultimate goal as zebic  he wants to succeed where zebek failed  by overthrowing the world government and  becoming the king of the world and he  doesn't want to achieve this through  liberation but through domination i plan  to dive into blackbeard's secret master  plan in another video but in the  meantime let me know what you guys think  is zebek really dead or could he be  alive could zebec be luffy's other  grandpa or is he maybe shanks's father  or blackbeard's dad take a few seconds  and drop me a comment down below i'd  love to get a good conversation going if  you're looking for a video to watch next  check out my video on all the known  d-clan members and their powers link in  the description don't forget to like and  subscribe if you enjoyed the video it  really helps me out a lot and of course  it's completely free and you can also  hit me up on twitter and instagram at  animeopror as always thank you guys so  much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys

